          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kedau ŋesi alomar, kopotu ikebulesin; koanyut, ido koany, egoikino ikekia luka agola; kotemasi atiar, “Abeit imukorit akekeje kagolake naelilim.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.3.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.3.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 3:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kidarata aitodol naerumiata ileic; ido koany, mam abu konaa ikekia luka agola; kosodete do kesi alemun elacet, koŋaasi kes; ido koany, atwanit ejakaitikee kibirokina kwap.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.3.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.3.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
